{"atom_id":"atom-0103","atom_type":"requirement","canonical_summary":"The Settings GUI must include a Goal Mode option that exposes two model selections: one for the worker model and one for the verifier/adjudicator model. The verifier/adjudicator model is configured separately from the other worker model.","compile_disposition":"create_new_planunit","compile_notes":"Compiled to live canonical Plans PlanUnits; governance seal completed.","compiled_at_utc":"2026-06-16T05:06:00Z","compiled_output_plan_unit_ids":["F3-393","MS-108"],"created_at_utc":"2026-06-16T04:22:00Z","exact_tokens":["option for goal mode in the settings gui","verifier/adjudicator model separate","other worker model","two model selections"],"gui_classification_reason":"Settings GUI controls and user-visible model selection UI.","gui_related":true,"lane":"settings_gui","ledger_id":"pldg-20260616-001-goal-runtime-system","negative_constraints":["Do not collapse Goal Mode worker and verifier/adjudicator model selection into one setting."],"owner_hints":["Plans/Goal_Runtime_System.md","Plans/FinalGUISpec.md","Plans/assistant-chat-design.md"],"plan_compile_targets":[],"schema_id":"pm.bootstrap_design_atom.v1","source_refs":["chat:goal-mode-model-selection-settings"],"status":"compiled_to_plan","superseded_by":[],"supersedes":[],"title":"Goal Mode settings exposes separate model selectors","updated_at_utc":"2026-06-16T20:30:00Z"}
{"atom_id":"atom-0104","atom_type":"requirement","canonical_summary":"Goal Mode runtime configuration must persist and apply separate role-model settings for worker execution and verifier/adjudicator authority. Provider-specific default model tier mappings remain deferred, but the runtime policy surface must support these two independently selectable model roles.","compile_disposition":"create_new_planunit","compile_notes":"Compiled to live canonical Plans PlanUnits; governance seal completed.","compiled_at_utc":"2026-06-16T05:06:00Z","compiled_output_plan_unit_ids":["GRS-010","F3-393","CV-286","MS-108","MA-060","GRS-025"],"created_at_utc":"2026-06-16T04:22:00Z","exact_tokens":["worker model","verifier/adjudicator model","separate","two model selections","model-role policy"],"gui_classification_reason":"Runtime/provider model-role configuration policy; not GUI/UI or visual implementation work.","gui_related":false,"lane":"model_role_policy","ledger_id":"pldg-20260616-001-goal-runtime-system","negative_constraints":["Do not hard-code one provider/model as required for correctness.","Do not force verifier/adjudicator work to use the same model setting as ordinary worker execution."],"owner_hints":["Plans/Goal_Runtime_System.md","Plans/Provider_OpenCode.md"],"plan_compile_targets":[],"schema_id":"pm.bootstrap_design_atom.v1","source_refs":["chat:goal-mode-model-selection-settings"],"status":"compiled_to_plan","superseded_by":[],"supersedes":[],"title":"Separate worker and verifier/adjudicator model policy","updated_at_utc":"2026-06-16T20:30:00Z"}
{"atom_id":"atom-0105","atom_type":"requirement","canonical_summary":"The verifier/adjudicator model may inherit the worker model only when the inherited model satisfies the required policy for the goal's certification tier. Low-risk goals can inherit by default; standard and strong-certification goals use policy-derived verifier/adjudicator requirements; strong-certification goals must block, not merely warn, when the verifier/adjudicator requirement cannot be met.","compile_disposition":"create_new_planunit","compile_notes":"Compiled to live canonical Plans PlanUnits; governance seal completed.","compiled_at_utc":"2026-06-16T05:06:00Z","compiled_output_plan_unit_ids":["GRS-010","F3-393","CV-286","MS-108","MA-060","GRS-025"],"created_at_utc":"2026-06-16T04:34:00Z","exact_tokens":["inherit the worker only when","satisfies the required policy","goal's certification tier","Low-risk goals can inherit by default","Standard and strong-certification goals","policy-derived verifier/adjudicator requirements","must block, not merely warn"],"gui_classification_reason":"Runtime/provider model policy; not GUI/UI or visual implementation work.","gui_related":false,"lane":"model_role_policy","ledger_id":"pldg-20260616-001-goal-runtime-system","negative_constraints":["Do not let strong-certification goals proceed with an underqualified verifier/adjudicator model.","Do not treat inheritance as always valid for verifier/adjudicator roles."],"owner_hints":["Plans/Goal_Runtime_System.md","Plans/Provider_OpenCode.md"],"plan_compile_targets":[],"schema_id":"pm.bootstrap_design_atom.v1","source_refs":["chat:lock-final-policy-defaults"],"status":"compiled_to_plan","superseded_by":[],"supersedes":[],"title":"Certification-tier verifier/adjudicator model requirements","updated_at_utc":"2026-06-16T20:30:00Z"}

